  "body": "## What changed\n\nA U-shaped open run defines a blind slot for 2D Offset, 2D Pocket, and 2D Adaptive.\nThe stock outline closes the open side.\nThe extension follows the two end tangents.\nThe three selected walls stay fixed.\nUnclear runs receive a named refusal.\nThe gouge and collision checks stay unchanged.\n\nThe accepted run has a convex cap and parallel outward end tangents.\nIts mouth is perpendicular to those tangents.\nThe stock must close one region that contains the mouth and the cap seed.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe open-band route required two separate walls.\nIt refused the three picked edges after they joined into one U-shaped run.\n\n## Tests\n\nThe generation and post-safety pins failed on unchanged upstream code.\nAll nine new pins pass with the fix.\n\n- `blind_slot_pocket_family_cuts_from_end_wall_to_stock_edge` checks all three operations with extension 0 and 7 mm.\n- `blind_slot_reversed_picks_keep_the_same_region` checks selection order and the blind-slot note.\n- `blind_slot_missing_side_wall_is_refused` checks an incomplete U selection.\n- `blind_slot_pass_through_kept_part_blocks_post` checks a blocking gouge and no output file.\n- `blind_slot_empty_and_nonfinite_runs_are_refused_by_name` checks malformed runs.\n- `blind_slot_nonparallel_ends_and_skew_mouth_are_refused` checks the two endpoint rules.\n- `blind_slot_folded_cap_is_refused` checks the convex-cap rule.\n- `blind_slot_stock_without_seed_cannot_choose_a_side` checks the side-selection rule.\n- `blind_slot_split_stock_is_refused` checks the one-region rule.\n\nRestoring `upstream/main` code in `open_band.rs` made the generation and post-safety pins fail again.\nRestoring the fix made them pass.\nBypassing each of the five new guards made its pin fail.\nRestoring each guard made its pin pass.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed its application and UI steps.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\nThe existing seven open-band tests passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\nThe diff contains no changed `.nc` or `.cl` files.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nManual UI operation and a physical machine run.\nConcave caps and nonparallel endpoint tangents remain unsupported and receive a refusal.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNo open PR changed the expected files during the overlap check.\n\nEffort: high\n\nChangelog: Accept a clear U-shaped blind-slot selection in the 2D pocket family and extend its open side to stock.\n\nFixes #1762\n",
